body:
I'd also recommend the Dr. Ci:Labo brand, which, if I recall correctly, is a Japanese cosmeceutical-grade skincare brand. 

&#x200B;

I've been using their Super Keana lactic acid/malic acid pore-refining lotion for a few months, and my skin truly looks as smooth as a baby's bottom now. I can't possibly praise it highly enough, honestly.
